  noMistakesText: {fileID: 4140117296132902576}
  resultText: {fileID: 0}
  guidance:
  - Mistake: 'Climbing too quickly: wait until the rung movement finishes.'
    Title: 
    CorrectAction: Wait until you finish moving to the current rung before taking
      the next step.
  - Mistake: Rushed climbing skipped a rung.
    Title: 
    CorrectAction: Climb one rung at a time. Finish each step before moving again.
  - Mistake: Climbing above the permitted standing limit.
    Title: 
    CorrectAction: Stay at or below the permitted standing rung. Descend if you climb
      above it.
  - Mistake: 'Overreach: leaning beyond the permitted range.'
    Title: 
    CorrectAction: Bring your balance back toward the center and keep your lean within
      the permitted range.
  - Mistake: Jumping on the ladder is unsafe.
    Title: 
    CorrectAction: Use the climb controls to move one rung at a time and descend
      to the bottom to dismount.
  - Mistake: You fell after sustained ladder instability.
    Title: 
    CorrectAction: Stop climbing when the ladder becomes unstable. Return your balance
      toward the center before continuing.
